msgid "# Qwen3.6-35B-A3B"
msgstr "# Qwen3.6-35B-A3B"

msgid ""
"Refer to [supported "
"features](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_features.md) to get the "
"model's supported feature matrix, including BF16, W8A8 quantization, chunked"
" prefill, automatic prefix caching, asynchronous scheduling, tensor "
"parallelism, expert parallelism, and ACLGraph support."
msgstr ""
"请参阅[支持的特性](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_features.md)获取该模型的支持特性，包括BF16、W8A8量化、分块预填充、自动前缀缓存、异步调度、张量并行、专家并行以及ACLGraph支持。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Feature Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) to get "
"feature configuration details."
msgstr "请参阅[功能指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)以获取功能配置详情。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Public Performance Tuning "
"Documentation](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)"
" for general tuning methods, and refer to [Feature "
"Matrix](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md) for feature "
"descriptions."
msgstr ""
"有关通用调优方法，请参阅[公共性能调优文档](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)，有关功能描述，请参阅[功能矩阵](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md)。"

msgid ""
"1. Use single-node deployment. If more throughput is required, increase local DP groups within the same node.\n"
"2. Choose the maximum context length with `--max-model-len`. Long context increases KV cache usage, so reduce `--max-num-seqs` or `--gpu-memory-utilization` if OOM occurs.\n"
"3. Tune `--max-num-batched-tokens`. Larger values usually improve prefill throughput but increase activation memory. Decode-heavy workloads usually need smaller values.\n"
"4. Tune `--max-num-seqs` according to service concurrency. Requests above this value wait in the queue and the waiting time is counted in TTFT and TPOT.\n"
"5. Tune `--gpu-memory-utilization`. Increase it to provide more KV cache, but leave headroom for runtime memory fluctuation and expert imbalance.\n"
"6. Tune ACLGraph capture. `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` is recommended for decode. If you set `cudagraph_capture_sizes` manually, include common decode batch sizes. With sequence parallelism, use capture sizes that are multiples of TP size."
msgstr ""
"1. 使用单节点部署。如果需要更高的吞吐量，请在同一节点内增加本地DP组。\n"
"2. 使用 `--max-model-len` 选择最大上下文长度。长上下文会增加KV缓存使用量，因此如果发生OOM，请减少 `--max-num-seqs` 或 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。\n"
"3. 调整 `--max-num-batched-tokens`。较大的值通常可以提高预填充吞吐量，但会增加激活内存。解码密集型工作负载通常需要较小的值。\n"
"4. 根据服务并发数调整 `--max-num-seqs`。超过此值的请求将在队列中等待，等待时间计入TTFT和TPOT。\n"
"5. 调整 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。增加该值以提供更多KV缓存，但需为运行时内存波动和专家不平衡留出余量。\n"
"6. 调整ACLGraph捕获。对于解码，建议使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`。如果手动设置 `cudagraph_capture_sizes`，请包含常见的解码批处理大小。使用序列并行时，请使用TP大小的倍数作为捕获大小。"

