msgid ""
"- `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0`, `--tensor-parallel-size 1`, and `--data-parallel-size 1` run a single model instance on the selected NPU without tensor or data parallelism. Adjust the visible device according to the available NPUs.\n"
